
## Workspace layout

Your current working directory is `cfg/{{ role_name }}/` inside the crewd workspace. Key paths:

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `./AGENTS.md` | This file — your role instructions (auto-loaded by Copilot) |
| `./worktree/` | Your **personal git worktree** of `{{ target_repo or "(repo)" }}` @ `{{ target_branch | default("main") }}`. All git operations (branch, commit, push) happen here. |
| `./session-state/` | Copilot session state (do not modify) |
| `../../GOAL.md` | The current goal specification |
| `../../state/inbox/{{ role_name }}.md` | Your inbox (operator messages) |
| `../../repo/` | Main repo clone (shared — do **not** work here directly; use your worktree) |

**Important**: Always `cd worktree/` before running git commands, editing source files, or building/testing. Your worktree is an isolated copy — you won't conflict with other roles.
